        "calls": 1,
        "text": "The service now distinguishes between three situations where an archived chat's files are unavailable: files that can be revived by sending a new message, files that only your desktop app can recover from a saved export, and files that are permanently gone. This internal update refines how the application communicates these specific error states to users. You will see more accurate guidance when an archived chat cannot load its previous work, such as being told to open your desktop app to restore a saved copy instead of being given a generic message.",
